flowchart LR
 U[User / respondent] <--> F[Flutter: chat and structured screening]
 F <--> S[(Local session storage)]
 F -->|HTTP / JSON| API[FastAPI gateway]
 API --> R[Intent router and safety rules]
 R --> G[TF-IDF retrieval and grounded prompt]
 C[(Prepared source corpus)] --> G
 G --> L[llama.cpp: Mistral 7B or Llama 3 8B]
 L -->|Response and citations via API| F
 API -->|Validated binary Q1–Q10 and background fields| E[EAIP-DARV service]
 E --> M1[Module 1: screening CNN]
 E --> M2[Module 2: ASSL]
 E --> M3[Module 3: cluster-based]
 M1 --> V[Calibration, agreement, EAIP and DARV voting]
 M2 --> V
 M3 --> V
 V -->|Screening result via API| F
 F --> P[Result, next steps and downloadable PDF]
